WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
«It's complicated.

2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.230
I'm not techy.»

3
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.960
Three steps. One:

4
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.820
add the contact from Telegram.

5
00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.370
Name, number and two lines about who they are.

6
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.450
Even with a voice note. Two:

7
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.370
the message is already there. Tap, WhatsApp opens on the right chat,

8
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.650
with the message inside. And you send it.

9
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.460
Three: when they reply, you paste the reply.

10
00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:25.220
Done. If you can send a voice note, you can use RelAI.
